# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LINDDUN-MAPPING / C3-VULMAP v2 — ignore rules
#
# Policy: this repository tracks CODE, MAPPING TABLES and DOCUMENTATION.
# Raw corpora and build artifacts are NOT tracked: several exceed GitHub's
# 100 MB hard per-file limit, and all of them are reproducible by running the
# numbered pipeline scripts. See c3_vulmap_v2/RUNGUIDE.md to regenerate them
# and cve_linddun/DATASET_CARD.md for how the released dataset is built.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- macOS cruft -----------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db

